    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark with up to 6 players on an underwater adventure to uncover treasures, shipwrecks, resources, or forgotten creatures. You\u2019ll also almost certainly find death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.poster.avif?t=1751292074\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.webp?t=1751292074\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.poster.avif?t=1751292074\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.webm?t=1751292074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.mp4?t=1751292074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print your gear, assign roles, and craft a careful strategy. Or just charge in headfirst\u2014whatever floats your submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/0fa0c1f57e0c9e6623efe9424950917e.poster.avif?t=1751292074\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/0fa0c1f57e0c9e6623efe9424950917e.webp?t=1751292074\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/ca6d37d4419bceae90157862d07ab8e1.poster.avif?t=1751292074\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/ca6d37d4419bceae90157862d07ab8e1.webm?t=1751292074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/ca6d37d4419bceae90157862d07ab8e1.mp4?t=1751292074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you think you know the area, you\u2019ll probably be in for a nasty surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/64c52a2b15db22a065d7dcdfa3ff0de3.poster.avif?t=1751292074\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/64c52a2b15db22a065d7dcdfa3ff0de3.webp?t=1751292074\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/d765e49eeebaf305044e29eef514295b.poster.avif?t=1751292074\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/d765e49eeebaf305044e29eef514295b.webm?t=1751292074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/d765e49eeebaf305044e29eef514295b.mp4?t=1751292074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your teammates have gone silent, and a menacing shadow looms. Muster all your courage\u2014and throw it as a distraction while you make a break for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re still alive, dive back in deeper.</p>",
